## Not run (sandbox limitation, disclosed rather than assumed)

npm ci / npx jest / npx tsc --noEmit could not be run from this session —
the sandbox's npm registry returns 403 on package installs. Verified by
hand that every existing test suite touched (superlatives.test.ts,
community-member-ranker.test.ts, automation-handlers-connect-people.test.ts)
uses a shared mock helper whose default response for an unconfigured table
is `{data: [], error: null}` — confirmed by reading each mock's source —
so the new Promise.all'd queries against service_bot_accounts/
notification_test_actors cannot break any existing assertion. The Gateway
Jest/Build Gate CI jobs on this PR are the first real execution of these
commands against this diff.
